> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>s1, s2<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"one\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"ONE\"</span>sv<span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"two\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"four\"</span>sv<span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"three\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"two\"</span>sv<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> res <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lexicographical_compare_three_way</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n            s1.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, s1.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, s2.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, s2.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, cmp_icase<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        show_result<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s1, s2, res<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>\"one\" is equal to \"ONE\"\n\"two\" is greater than \"four\"\n\"three\" is less than \"two\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</